/**
 * Return indices of elements in `seq` whose values are within the inclusive range [boundA, boundB].
 *
 * Behavior:
 * - Works with arrays and array-like iterables (anything Array.from accepts).
 * - Bounds order doesn't matter (function will use the min and max of the two bounds).
 * - Comparison uses JavaScript's >= and <= operators (so it works for numbers and strings,
