 * Count frequencies of unique (col1, col2) pairs in a table.
 *
 * @param {Array<Object|Array>} table - Array of rows. Each row is either:
 *     - an object with properties col1 and col2 (or custom names you pass),
 *     - or an array/tuple where [0] is col1 and [1] is col2.
