const cleaned = dropConsecutiveDuplicates(tbl);
console.log(cleaned.objects());
```

Notes:
- Equality is strict equality by column values; row-by-row (all columns) equality is used.
- The first row is always preserved (its lag is undefined).
- The function returns an Arquero Table; call .objects() to get an array of plain objects.

