 * Compute mean values for specified rows and columns from a 2D data table
 * @param {Array<Array<number>>} data - 2D array of numeric values
 * @param {Array<number>} rowIndices - Array of row indices to include
 * @param {Array<number>} colIndices - Array of column indices to include
 * @returns {Object} Object containing rowMeans and columnMeans
