 * Filter a dataset based on two column conditions
 * @param {dfd.DataFrame} df0 - The input dataframe
 * @param {string} var0 - First column name
 * @param {*} val0 - Value to match in first column
 * @param {string} var1 - Second column name
 * @param {*} val1 - Value to match in second column
 * @returns {dfd.DataFrame} Filtered dataframe
